WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.710
I'll never forget, before
I joined the army, Ima

2
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.240
was talking to him about
keeping me in Jerusalem.

3
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:13.290
And I wanted to go further
from Jerusalem, from home.

4
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.110
I just wanted to be independent,
because of this strict life we had been

5
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.260
raised with. It was time for
me to see what's out there.

6
00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:28.360
After Ima talked to Moshe,
it was already decided:

7
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:34.770
I'm staying in Jerusalem.
Moshe made sure that I

8
00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:40.740
lived at home even two
years after high school.

9
00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.610
Moshe could do anything and everything.

10
00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:47.660
If you needed something from
him, you just had to ask.

11
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.420
He was just a phone call away.

12
00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:53.120
And he always followed through.
